Global changes
--------------

fmemopen.3
getaddrinfo.3
mq_notify.3
offsetof.3
aio.7
    Michael Kerrisk
        Print size_t/ssize_t values using %z printf() modifier
            There are fewer and fewer systems these days that don't
            support the %z specifier mandated in C99.  So replace the
            use of %ld/%lu + (long) cast with %zd/%zu.


